      "content": "Please complete your analysis of the three-part test you mentioned. \n\nAdditionally, could you elaborate on how the courts treat events characterized by \"chaotic\" or \"unpredictable\" external elements? Specifically, if the disruption is not a single discrete event but rather a series of smaller, erratic, or seemingly irrational interruptions to public order, how does that impact the legal determination of foreseeability?",
